 },
 "summary": "A family of surface-mount polarised aluminum capacitors whose electrolyte is a solid conductive polymer, in seven can sizes from 5.0 × 5.9 mm to 10.0 × 12.6 mm. Ratings run from 16 V to 50 V and 10 µF to 1000 µF at ±20 %, with ESR from 12 mΩ to 40 mΩ maximum and ripple current ratings of 2450 to 5400 mA rms at 100 kHz and +105 °C. The category range is −55 °C to +105 °C and endurance is 5000 h at +105 °C under rated voltage. The parts are RoHS compliant and halogen free.",
